  <entry>
    <title>내신 리셋하려 자퇴했는데 — 2028학년도부터는 정시에서도 학생부를 본다</title>
    <link href="https://tuhbm.github.io/2026/09/23/dropoutResetRisk/"/>
    <id>https://tuhbm.github.io/2026/09/23/dropoutResetRisk/</id>
    <published>2026-09-23T01:30:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-09-24T04:49:00.511Z</updated>
    
    <summary type="html">
    
